      "id": "1",
      "title": "Welcome to Switch",
      "slug": "welcome-to-switch",
      "excerpt": "We're building games for the next generation of players — and the brands that want to reach them.",
      "content": "<p>Switch was founded with a single belief: games are the most powerful cultural medium of our time.</p><p>We build inside Roblox — the platform where 80 million daily players come to play, create, and belong. Our team brings together deep game design expertise with cultural fluency, crafting worlds that players actually return to.</p><p>This is just the beginning. Stay close.</p>",
      "coverVideoUrl": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_38xzZboKViGWJOttwIXH07lWA1P/hf_20260421_102157_ad7d8fd0-1039-4516-8d40-db76927cc9c5.mp4",
      "publishedAt": "2026-04-01T00:00:00.000Z",
